{
  "ALL_TEXT": "83 INT. ROADSIDE DHABA - DAY\nVEDA escorts GOVARDHAN and SULOCHANA inside the empty dhaba\nso that they can talk in peace.\nVEDA\n(with terrible guilt)\nNannante etla... naa peru kuda\ncheppaaru ga!\nGOVARDHAN\nNee photo eyyaledu gaa... peru tho\naemundi...nannu ganuka police lu\npattukunte maatram ee plan aesindi\nmottam nuvve ani cheptha. Naaku uri\nsiksha padinaa parvaaaledu, neeku\npadetattu chustha...\nVEDA\nAnte pattukunnaaka kuda nijam\ncheppavaa?\nGOVARDHAN\nThokkalo nijam... evadu\nnammuthaaadu!?... Nannirikisthe\nirikkichaav... help cheddam ani\nochina pilla nu kudaa ila cheyatam\nem baaledu VEDA... asalu manishiva\npa..\nVEDA\nNenem chesaanu??? Lopala nuvvem\nchesaavo... aa Baba ni em\nkelikaavo... vaadu ila thirigaadu.\nSULOCHANA\nAsalu lopala em jarigindi???\nGOVARDHAN\nLopala jarigina daaniki deeniki em\nsambandham ledu... nannu adagaddhu\naa vishayam gurichi malli.\nVEDA takes SULOCHANA aside and tells her what happened.\nGOVARDHAN gets pissed that she now knows.\nGOVARDHAN\nOorantha cheppesi ra!...\nVEDA\nMari theliyaali kadha... lekapothe\nthanaki doubt untadi kadha...asalu\nactual ga emi jarigindhi lopala\nToo irritated, conscious and a little ashamed\nGOVARDHAN\nLedhu... Baba ni naalugu peeki\nvochanu anthey..inka emi\ncheyaledhu.\nVEDA\nMari anthalone emayyindhi...\nGOVARDHAN\nEmo!! Nakem thelusu!!!\nVEDA\nSare aravaddhu le...\nVEDA speaks to SULOCHANA\nVEDA\nEvaro manalni kaavaalani indulo\nirikisthunnaaru... asalu hathyaalu\nchesindi evaro thelisthe kaani\nmanam em cheyyalemu... Naakidhi\nchaala pedda kutra la anipisthundi.\nGOVARDHAN\nAa... Nuvvu PM, nenu governor, adho\naavidemo Rajasthan CM... andhuke\nmanameeda kutra... Manalni\nmaamuluga pattichukune vaade ledu,\naalochinchi irikkichevaallu kuda\nna!?\nVEDA\nAaputhaava nee satirelu.\nSULOCHANA\nAnduke manameeda kutra.\nVEDA\nEnti?\nSULOCHANA\nManalni pattichukune vaallu evvaru\nlerane manalni\nirikkisthunnaaremo...\nSULOCHANA\nmugguram maamulu middle class\nfamily vaallam... manevvariki pedda\ncontacts levu help cheyataaniki...\nanduke manalni plan ga\nirikisthunnaaremo!\nThe three absorb this for a while.\nVEDA\nAssalevarantav??\nSULOCHANA\nEmo...\nSULOCHANA thinks for a while\nSULOCHANA\nSare alochiddham kaani, mundhu food\norder chesi thindham naaku aakali\nvesthundhi.\nVEDA orders some food.\nGOVARDHAN\nNaako kumpatti pettandi\nVEDA\nKumpatti enti raa\nGOVARDHAN\nNenu clean gaa unte ne thinta\nledante nenu tinanu\nVEDA\nOrei nee abba idi hotel raa,ikkada\naydhi dorikithe adhi tinaali\nGOVARDHAN\nLedhu ledhu, nenu fruits unte ne\nthintaanu, fruits levante nenu\nvandukuntaanu\nVEDA\nNee abba, adi emi kudaradu,\ntinakapote chaavu\nFood is served to VEDA and SULOCHANA. They begin digging in.\nGOVARDHAN\nMeere thintu chusthe naaku kuda\naakalesthundi\nVEDA\nSare thintaava edi?\nGOVARDHAN nods and helps himself.\nCUT TO:",
